{"id":"vod_sn_36947","vodId":"36947","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"七魔剑支配天下","name_cn":"七魔剑支配天下","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全15集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3024e547fb571d1d28a78a2917bf38d1.jpg"},"summary":"舞台是名门金伯利魔法学校。在这所学校，毕业前有两成学生或残废或失踪，还有人发狂并最终死去。这就是所谓的“为魔所噬”——春天，奥利佛·霍恩来到了金伯利。他温和而理性，背后却有着若隐若现的阴影。他身边聚集起出身背景各不相同的少年少女，并与魔法师们尽可能地互相切磋。这些未来的魔法师们满怀希望地走过了学园的大门。然而，人称魔境的金伯利却对他们露出了危险的獠牙。与伙伴们邂逅，前往魔境的他将面临什么样的命运――于是，围绕“七魔剑”展开的故事，现在，开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-14 01:02:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":15,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/LHzP6Ggbzu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/yKPxn7wASb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/TA1QX7Tc0c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ekS0kLF3EX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/GuxqHaWAiE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/4ZHTXAQnYr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mSD0N6Jtqk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/yyuaTjb5zn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/4GWbqpjFmd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202309/19/ykS9F0CKwi2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202309/19/ZkeRxbwgwe2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202309/23/kdU83ASfrs2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202309/30/GiiQ2MCy8j2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202310/07/V1b4RLG8zk2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202310/14/BgQ68zYsiq2/video/index.m3u8"}]}]